## Fixes

### Critical: Duplicate condition in getIntValue
**sevenzip_impl.cpp:77** - Removed duplicate `VT_UI1` check that masked proper type handling:

```cpp
// Before
if (prop.vt == VT_UI1 || prop.vt == VT_UI1 || prop.vt == VT_I1)

// After  
if (prop.vt == VT_UI1 || prop.vt == VT_I1)
```

### Critical: Incorrect control flow in getIntValue
**sevenzip_impl.cpp:74-86** - Changed sequential `if` statements to `else if` chain. Previous code allowed multiple branches to execute, causing only the last matching condition to set `propValue`:

```cpp
// Before: All branches evaluate, only last match takes effect
if (prop.vt == VT_UI1 || prop.vt == VT_UI1 || prop.vt == VT_I1)
    propValue = prop.bVal;
if (prop.vt == VT_UI2 || prop.vt == VT_I2)
    propValue = prop.uiVal;
if (prop.vt == VT_UI4 || prop.vt == VT_I4)
    propValue = prop.ulVal;
else
    return E_FAIL;

// After: Proper early exit on first match
if (prop.vt == VT_UI1 || prop.vt == VT_I1)
    propValue = prop.bVal;
else if (prop.vt == VT_UI2 || prop.vt == VT_I2)
    propValue = prop.uiVal;
else if (prop.vt == VT_UI4 || prop.vt == VT_I4)
    propValue = prop.ulVal;
else
    return E_FAIL;
```

### Style: Remove standalone semicolons
**sevenzip.cpp:114, 138** - Removed extraneous semicolons after function closing braces.

