**New:** `class-tabesh-ai-page-analyzer.php`, `ai-page-analyzer.js`

Extracts and sanitizes DOM structure (forms, buttons, navigation, hovered elements) to build rich context for AI responses. Detects page type and summarizes filled form fields.

