## Automatic Field Explainer

**New:** `class-tabesh-ai-field-explainer.php`, `ai-field-explainer.js`, `ai-instant-highlight.css`

Auto-explains form fields on focus/change. Uses predefined Persian explanations for common fields (paper types, binding, book sizes), falls back to Gemini for complex fields. 5-minute transient cache. Debounced at 500-800ms.

```php
