## User Persona Builder

**New:** `class-tabesh-ai-persona-builder.php`

Analyzes behavior history to detect:
- Profession (author/publisher/printer/buyer) from URL patterns and event data
- Experience level from visit count and confusion signals
- Current intent from recent page views
- Interests from content keywords
- Confusion signals (idle time, rapid clicks, form abandonment)

Persona summary automatically sent with all Gemini requests.

## Site Page Indexer

**New:** `class-tabesh-ai-site-indexer.php`, DB table `wp_tabesh_ai_site_pages`

Scans sitemap.xml daily via cron (`tabesh_ai_index_site_pages`), extracts title/summary/keywords, detects page type. 0.1s delay between pages. Persian stop words filtered from keywords.

```sql
